      "title": "GPN Q3 Earnings Beat Estimates on Genius Growth, Margins Rise",
      "summary": "Global Payments reported Q3 2026 adjusted EPS of $3.58, beating estimates by 0.3%, with adjusted net revenues rising 31% year-over-year to $3.18 billion. The company expanded operating margins by 220 basis points to 42.5% and raised its synergy target to $650 million. GPN reaffirmed full-year guidance and expects over $2 billion in shareholder returns for 2026. Peers Visa, Mastercard, and Marsh & McLennan also reported strong quarterly results.",
